// highlight.js placeholder
//
// Syntax highlighting is optional. The dev-review UI works without it — code
// snippets and diffs render as plain text on the warm dark panel. To enable
// language-aware highlighting, replace this file with the real highlight.min.js
// bundle from https://highlightjs.org/download/ (any common languages build is
// fine; ts/js/py/go/sql/sh covers most phase agents' output). Also drop a
// theme at ./highlight-theme.css.
//
// The UI calls window.hljs.highlightElement(el) if and only if window.hljs
// exists, so this placeholder simply defines nothing and the UI falls through.
